760
00:26:48,485 --> 00:26:50,014
- They're here.
- They're here.

761
00:26:50,015 --> 00:26:51,345
Stay focused.

762
00:26:51,585 --> 00:26:53,084
- They're here.
- Figure out the number of people...

763
00:26:53,085 --> 00:26:54,614
- by listening.
- We stopped by.

764
00:26:54,615 --> 00:26:56,284
- It's Director Yeong Seok.
- What? No way.

765
00:26:56,285 --> 00:26:57,384
(It's Director Yeong Seok.)

766
00:26:57,385 --> 00:26:58,495
It's Director Yeong Seok.

767
00:26:58,895 --> 00:27:00,454
