768
00:27:00,455 --> 00:27:01,625
I can't understand the menu.

769
00:27:03,025 --> 00:27:04,064
Excuse me.

770
00:27:04,065 --> 00:27:05,465
Excuse me?

771
00:27:05,565 --> 00:27:06,565
Ma'am?

772
00:27:06,835 --> 00:27:08,964
- Yes, I'm coming.
- Excuse me.

773
00:27:08,965 --> 00:27:10,304
- "Yes, I'm coming."
- "Yes, I'm coming."

774
00:27:10,305 --> 00:27:12,605
(After one day, she mastered the customer service tone.)

775
00:27:12,735 --> 00:27:13,735
Did you call me?

776
00:27:13,736 --> 00:27:16,505
You don't even come when we call you. Why are you so slow?

777
00:27:16,745 --> 00:27:18,675
If you're in such a hurry, you should've come yesterday.

778
00:27:19,345 --> 00:27:21,274
- Here's some dongchimi.
- Yesterday?

779
00:27:21,275 --> 00:27:22,284
- Thank you.
- What's this?

780
00:27:22,285 --> 00:27:24,684
This is dongchimi that we serve you on the side.

781
00:27:24,685 --> 00:27:25,984
- It's yuzu dongchimi.
- I see.

782
00:27:25,985 --> 00:27:27,514
- This looks good.
- Yes.

783
00:27:27,515 --> 00:27:28,985
- By the way...
- Yes?

784
00:27:29,225 --> 00:27:32,294
I don't understand the menu at all.

785
00:27:32,295 --> 00:27:34,825
- Can you explain it to us?
- Sure.

786
00:27:35,125 --> 00:27:36,394
Chestnut Tyranno!

787
00:27:36,395 --> 00:27:37,425
(Laughing)

788
00:27:37,665 --> 00:27:38,764
