795
00:27:49,745 --> 00:27:52,044
- Chestnut Tyranno is...
- What kind of dish is it?

796
00:27:52,045 --> 00:27:53,315
Chestnut Tyranno is...

797
00:27:53,645 --> 00:27:55,584
