801
00:28:04,585 --> 00:28:07,755
Challenge! Beat Lee Young Ji, 175cm Tall.

802
00:28:07,995 --> 00:28:11,525
Don't Eat Ghost Pepper Tteokbokki, It's a Challenge.

803
00:28:12,795 --> 00:28:14,435
