808
00:28:21,535 --> 00:28:23,904
It's extremely spicy, and the portion is quite big.

809
00:28:23,905 --> 00:28:26,444
It contains 175cm of rice cake.

810
00:28:26,445 --> 00:28:27,975
Is it okay for four of us to eat?

811
00:28:28,215 --> 00:28:29,814
Our food is always good.

812
00:28:29,815 --> 00:28:30,815
(Approaching slowly)

813
00:28:30,945 --> 00:28:32,114
- Also, - I guarantee it.

814
00:28:32,115 --> 00:28:33,654
