818
00:28:38,925 --> 00:28:40,224
It's a signed pot.

819
00:28:40,225 --> 00:28:42,294
A pot signed by a famous celebrity.

820
00:28:42,295 --> 00:28:43,795
We have many pots at home, so...

821
00:28:43,965 --> 00:28:45,665
Hurry up and order, please!

822
00:28:45,835 --> 00:28:47,164
