- Is it the standard size?

827
00:28:57,945 --> 00:28:59,145
One pollack roe and clam pasta.

828
00:28:59,345 --> 00:29:00,474
Two Chestnut Tyranno.

829
00:29:00,475 --> 00:29:02,214
One challenge tteokbokki. That's all.

830
00:29:02,215 --> 00:29:03,245
That's crazy.

831
00:29:03,715 --> 00:29:04,915
They ordered a lot.

832
00:29:06,185 --> 00:29:07,385
- Okay.
- Okay.

833
00:29:07,585 --> 00:29:08,624
All right.

834
00:29:08,625 --> 00:29:10,785
(It's coming right up. We'll make it delicious.)

835
00:29:12,955 --> 00:29:14,495
Is this a library?

836
00:29:14,795 --> 00:29:16,925
- No one is saying a word.
- No one?

837
00:29:17,295 --> 00:29:18,395
They're completely focused.

838
00:29:19,935 --> 00:29:23,605
(Silence)

839
00:29:23,865 --> 00:29:25,635
(They're not studying.)

840
00:29:25,805 --> 00:29:27,605
(They're making tteokbokki.)

841
00:29:27,735 --> 00:29:29,505
One, two, three, four, five.

842
00:29:30,045 --> 00:29:32,975
(They're making fried food.)

843
00:29:33,745 --> 00:29:35,785
(Stifling a laugh)

844
00:29:35,945 --> 00:29:37,115
What do you need?

845
00:29:37,545 --> 00:29:38,815
This serious atmosphere...

846
00:29:39,285 --> 00:29:40,914
(Serious Chef Kim Mi Hyun...)

847
00:29:40,915 --> 00:29:43,224
(and Mr. Pollack Roe and Clam Pasta)

848
00:29:43,225 --> 00:29:44,225
This is me.

849
00:29:44,226 --> 00:29:45,694
- Is it you?
- This is Lee Young Ji Tteokbokki.

850
00:29:45,695 --> 00:29:46,825
Nice.

851
00:29:46,995 --> 00:29:48,695
(The dishes are ready.)

852
00:29:48,865 --> 00:29:49,965
Excuse me.

853
00:29:50,495 --> 00:29:51,564
I was saying...

854
00:29:51,565 --> 00:29:53,335
(Here's your order.)

855
00:29:53,465 --> 00:29:54,494
This is your...

856
00:29:54,495 --> 00:29:57,065
- Lee Young Ji Tteokbokki.
- My gosh.

857
00:29:57,565 --> 00:29:59,534
This is pollack roe and clam pasta.

858
00:29:59,535 --> 00:30:01,135
- Pollack roe and clam pasta?
- Yes.

859
00:30:01,505 --> 00:30:04,244
- I'll put it in the center.
- My goodness.

860
00:30:04,245 --> 00:30:05,514
(Challenge! Beat Lee Young Ji, 175cm Tall)

861
00:30:05,515 --> 00:30:07,144
- What's this?
- It's the dessert.

862
00:30:07,145 --> 00:30:09,185
This is Chestnut Tyranno.

863
00:30:10,485 --> 00:30:11,515
- Gosh, this is...
- Oh, my.

864
00:30:12,215 --> 00:30:13,385
It looks amazing.

865
00:30:14,085 --> 00:30:16,385
(Taking a bite of the fried food first)

866
00:30:17,085 --> 00:30:18,085
She's running away.

867
00:30:18,086 --> 00:30:19,825
- Excuse me.
- Yes?

868
00:30:19,995 --> 00:30:21,295
