880
00:30:47,315 --> 00:30:49,325
I sincerely apologise again.

881
00:30:50,955 --> 00:30:52,224
- Okay.
- I'm sorry.

882
00:30:52,225 --> 00:30:53,424
I apologise.

883
00:30:53,425 --> 00:30:55,394
We'll be more careful next time.

884
00:30:55,395 --> 00:30:58,095
I'm sorry, and I'll give you today's drink...

885
00:30:58,695 --> 00:31:00,064
- on the house.
- Thank you.

886
00:31:00,065 --> 00:31:01,335
I apologise.

887
00:31:01,395 --> 00:31:03,264
A bone like this is fine.

888
00:31:03,265 --> 00:31:04,504
- May I take your plate?
- Yes.

889
00:31:04,505 --> 00:31:05,674
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

890
00:31:05,675 --> 00:31:07,134
Let me know if you need anything.

891
00:31:07,135 --> 00:31:08,305
(Clapping)

892
00:31:08,635 --> 00:31:10,675
- Is it solved? Oh, my.
- It's okay.

893
00:31:11,045 --> 00:31:12,244
Difficult customers like them...

894
00:31:12,245 --> 00:31:13,744
