- Yes.

900
00:31:28,595 --> 00:31:29,694
This is really good.

901
00:31:29,695 --> 00:31:31,165
- Actually, this...
- I never had it before.

902
00:31:31,365 --> 00:31:32,594
The texture...

903
00:31:32,595 --> 00:31:34,694
