904
00:31:34,695 --> 00:31:35,904
But the sauce is delicious.

905
00:31:35,905 --> 00:31:36,935
I agree.

906
00:31:37,135 --> 00:31:39,904
(Next is pollack roe and clam pasta made by the sous-chef.)

907
00:31:39,905 --> 00:31:41,105
