- How about...

965
00:33:26,275 --> 00:33:27,275
Jade Emperor Tteokbokki.

966
00:33:27,276 --> 00:33:28,714
- It's Jade Emperor Tteokbokki.
- That sounds great.

967
00:33:28,715 --> 00:33:29,784
It's so spicy...

968
00:33:29,785 --> 00:33:30,845
