- By the way...

969
00:33:30,915 --> 00:33:32,314
(As a challenge dish, it's extremely spicy.)

970
00:33:32,315 --> 00:33:33,954
(Made with 175cm of rice cake)

971
00:33:33,955 --> 00:33:35,384
(A more approachable version of mala tteokbokki)

972
00:33:35,385 --> 00:33:36,855
