988
00:33:59,345 --> 00:34:01,215
How about Goguryeo Coffee?

989
00:34:01,575 --> 00:34:02,784
Fancy...

990
00:34:02,785 --> 00:34:04,745
- Fancy coffee slushy.
- Fancy.

991
00:34:04,945 --> 00:34:06,785
What about the pomegranate slushy?

992
00:34:07,155 --> 00:34:09,224
Crunchy pomegranate slushy.

993
00:34:09,225 --> 00:34:10,984
