1598
00:56:35,335 --> 00:56:36,335
Honesty.

1599
00:56:36,336 --> 00:56:37,364
- Humility.
- Humility.

1600
00:56:37,365 --> 00:56:39,065
- Ahk.
- Ahk.

1601
