1619
00:57:17,005 --> 00:57:18,975
This tteokbokki is amazing.

1620
00:57:19,605 --> 00:57:22,815
Which restaurant is this tteokbokki from?

1621
00:57:23,645 --> 00:57:25,385
Which restaurant is this from?

1622
00:57:25,815 --> 00:57:27,015
Tteokbokki is so tasty.

1623
00:57:27,385 --> 00:57:29,855
Yu Jin, isn't the tteokbokki here really good?

1624
00:57:30,255 --> 00:57:31,684
Tteokbokki is so good.

1625
00:57:31,685 --> 00:57:32,854
It's so delicious.

1626
