1683
00:59:34,715 --> 00:59:36,144
What am I going to do with this spoiled brat?

1684
00:59:36,145 --> 00:59:37,984
- It's break time.
- She...

1685
00:59:37,985 --> 00:59:39,784
No, it's not. It's business hours!

1686
00:59:39,785 --> 00:59:41,215
Sorry.

1687
00:59:41,655 --> 00:59:43,114
Why are you doing this? I quit.

1688
00:59:43,115 --> 00:59:45,424
Is your concept for this season not a cute idol singer...

1689
00:59:45,425 --> 00:59:46,655
