1690
00:59:46,885 --> 00:59:48,395
How can you say that?

1691
00:59:48,655 --> 00:59:49,994
- I quit.
- Are you Goguryeo?

1692
00:59:49,995 --> 00:59:51,264
- Eun Ji, I quit.
- Again.

1693
00:59:51,265 --> 00:59:53,194
- Do it again.
- Do what?

1694
00:59:53,195 --> 00:59:54,364
Pose again.

1695
00:59:54,365 --> 00:59:56,365
I'm taking a video. Take screenshots of it later.

1696
00:59:57,535 --> 00:59:58,864
- Hold on.
- Take screenshots.

1697
00:59:58,865 --> 01:00:00,134
- I'm so shocked.
- Look here.

1698
01:00:00,135 --> 01:00:01,934
Not having any customers is shocking as is,

1699
01:00:01,935 --> 01:00:03,534
- Look here.
