1700
01:00:03,535 --> 01:00:05,504
The servers are acting like this.

1701
01:00:05,505 --> 01:00:06,674
- Eun Ji, come here.
- Hold on.

1702
01:00:06,675 --> 01:00:08,615
I'm so shocked. Excuse me, Mimi.

1703
01:00:08,845 --> 01:00:10,245
I'm so shocked.

1704
