We sell tteokbokki.

1705
01:00:14,415 --> 01:00:16,085
Come and have tteokbokki.

1706
01:00:18,325 --> 01:00:21,025
There's nobody around.

1707
01:00:21,825 --> 01:00:23,455
Come and have tteokbokki.

1708
01:00:25,525 --> 01:00:27,234
There's nobody at all.

1709
01:00:27,235 --> 01:00:28,734
(Young Ji talks alone, and Young Ji listens alone.)

1710
01:00:28,735 --> 01:00:30,265
