01:20:02,105 --> 01:20:03,705
- You'll go with the original.
- This one.

2254
01:20:03,805 --> 01:20:05,204
- Medium size?
- Yes.

2255
01:20:05,205 --> 01:20:07,145
Okay. Medium size, it is.

2256
01:20:07,445 --> 01:20:11,044
(In the meantime, in the kitchen,)

2257
01:20:11,045 --> 01:20:13,545
